@page "/privacy"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy • BoostedRotary.com</PageTitle>

<div class="container max-w-3xl space-y-6 py-10">
    <div class="space-y-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">Last updated May 6, 2026</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-foreground/70">
            BoostedRotary.com collects only the information needed to run accounts, builds, shop features, alerts, analytics, and billing.
        </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/75">
            We may collect account details, build data, plan and billing status, price alert requests, vendor click activity, and basic technical data such as IP-derived analytics and browser session identifiers.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">How We Use It</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/75">
            We use this information to provide the builder, manage accounts and plans, send requested emails, operate billing, improve catalog quality, protect the service, and understand site usage.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Service Providers</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/75">
            We use providers such as hosting, database, email, analytics, and payment processors to operate the service. Payment card details are handled by Stripe and are not stored directly by BoostedRotary.com.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Choices</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/75">
            You can manage your account, unsubscribe from optional emails where available, and contact us to request changes or deletion of account information when legally and operationally possible.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/75">
            For privacy requests, contact the site operator through the support channel published for BoostedRotary.com.
        </p>
    </section>
</div>
